  },
  "runtimeDependencies": [
    "AmigaOS m68k with a 68020-class CPU for the installed KEY 020 build",
    "External clients under LIBS:xad"
  ],
  "notes": [
    "Aminet labels this 68020 archive 12.1a. Its exact library identifies as 12.1 KEY 020, and the archive supplies the eight xad commands and installed external clients.",
    "The archive member xad/Libs/xad/R.A.W. extracts as R.A.W_ under 7-Zip on Windows. The release ZIP and stock hardfile install Libs/xad/__uae___R_A_W_.",
    "The xad copy of X-Systems.TXT maps to the xad release. The stock xfd copy has the same SHA-256 and maps to the xfd release.",
    "The xadmaster key and customized English help icons use checked BCWB inputs. The shared English xad help drawer also contains the exe2arc documentation assigned to Batch 34."
  ],
